<h1>Backfill proposals</h1>

<div class="card muted">
  What a boot-time sweep found missing and held back instead of sending, because the gap was
  larger than a quiet restart should ever recover on its own. Opening a row shows the messages it
  would send: the author, when it was said, and enough of it to recognise. Accepting relays that
  exact list, one message a second, through whichever bot process is currently running; nothing is
  recomputed at the moment you click.
  <br><br>
  Watch the <strong>ours, skipped</strong> number first. It is how many of the fetched messages the
  sweep decided were already our own relayed copies. A zero there on a channel that has bridged
  before means the ownership check is not doing its job right now, and nothing should be accepted
  until that is fixed.
  <br><br>
  A preview is kept only for proposals still waiting on a decision, the same short-lived exception
  PRIVACY.md documents for the live room preview: it is pruned once the proposal is decided or
  expires, whether or not anyone looked.
</div>

<h2>Waiting on a decision</h2>
<%= backfill_proposals_table(@pending, communities: @communities, state: :pending,
                             empty: "Nothing is waiting on a decision.") %>

<% if @awaiting_relay.any? %>
  <h2>Accepted, not yet confirmed sent</h2>
  <div class="card muted">
    Accepted here, but the bot has not confirmed the whole list went out, either because it is
    still working through the pace or because it could not be reached. Retry asks it again; that is
    safe to press more than once, since the bot skips anything it already relayed.
  </div>
  <%= backfill_proposals_table(@awaiting_relay, communities: @communities, state: :awaiting_relay,
                               empty: "") %>
<% end %>

<% if @expired.any? %>
  <h2>Expired</h2>
  <div class="card muted">Nobody decided in time. A fresh sweep proposes the channel again if the gap is still there.</div>
  <%= backfill_proposals_table(@expired, communities: @communities, state: :expired, empty: "") %>
<% end %>
